        "command": "ip nat pool address-group1 11.11.11.101 11.11.11.105 netmask 255.255.255.0",
        "explanation": "Configure the NAT pool with the name Adress-group1, IP range 11.11.11.101 to 11.11.105, subnet mask 255.255.255.0",
        "parameters": [
            {
